RCP/M GLOSSARY

A - System terms
:A
SYSTEM TERMS

RCP/M    Remote CP/M, a CP/M computer available to callers.
Sysop    System operator.
Caller   Someone calling the remote computer.
BYE      Resident remote-operation software; also the logoff command.
DU       Drive and user area, such as J3:.
NDR      Named directory register (Z-System).
LBR      A library containing several files.
RBBS     The bulletin board program.
WORK     Temporary workspace, cleared at call boundaries.
F4       File attribute used here for caller executable approval.
